    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII helper that auto-times and auto-emits a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1network_1_1_network_span_event" kindref="compound">NetworkSpanEvent</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Constructs a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1network_1_1_network_span_event" kindref="compound">NetworkSpanEvent</ref></computeroutput> on the stack, starts a steady_clock timer on construction, and calls <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1network_1_1_network_observability_registry_1a257d9390b933e09738eb76662b3f44ba" kindref="member">NetworkObservabilityRegistry::instance()</ref></computeroutput>.<ref refid="classthemis_1_1network_1_1_network_span_1a82fb7cd062db48701edd321651a7e85c" kindref="member">emit()</ref> on destruction. Callers set fields via fluent setters before the span goes out of scope.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1network_1_1_network_span_1ad169421f76ba13d327dc34a84dfccf48" kindref="member">NetworkSpan</ref><sp/>span(<ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1network_1a4231eea11760549a1f964cb85962655fa022afa1f4831e3e7cf99d54ba3ac38bd" kindref="member">NetworkSpanKind::AUTH_CHECK</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>span.setConnectionId(conn_id).setResultCode(<ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1network_1a82a6c265c978a1d9c7b1e56bc41443c2ae0aa021e21dddbd6d8cecec71e9cf564" kindref="member">NetworkResultCode::OK</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>perform<sp/>auth<sp/>check<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>auto-emits<sp/>on<sp/>scope<sp/>exit</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
